/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (27. Thailand stresses that the right of self-defence must not be used to justify preemptive or preventive use of force in cyberspace. Measures taken in self-defence must be exercised with the utmost caution to avoid escalation, miscalculation, and unintended consequences.)
/E (27. Thailand stresses that the right of self-defence must not be used to justify preemptive or preventive use of force in cyberspace. Measures taken in self-defence must be exercised with the utmost caution to avoid escalation, miscalculation, and unintended consequences.)
