/T (40. Thailand emphasizes that the protection of human rights in the digital environment is essential to the responsible use of ICTs and to preserving the openness, accessibility, and inclusivity of cyberspace, thereby fostering trust, innovation, and inclusive development in the digital domain, and promoting a secure, stable, and rights-respecting cyberspace. Thailand also welcomes the adoption of the UN Convention against Cybercrime which includes the elements related to human rights protection.)
/E (40. Thailand emphasizes that the protection of human rights in the digital environment is essential to the responsible use of ICTs and to preserving the openness, accessibility, and inclusivity of cyberspace, thereby fostering trust, innovation, and inclusive development in the digital domain, and promoting a secure, stable, and rights-respecting cyberspace. Thailand also welcomes the adoption of the UN Convention against Cybercrime which includes the elements related to human rights protection.)
