/S /H1
/T (B. Attribution 45. Thailand affirms that attribution of cyber activities to a State must be consistent with the established principles of international law. A cyber operation is attributable to a State if it is carried out by its organs, or by persons or groups acting on its instructions, or under its direction or control, among other forms of attribution, in accordance with Articles 4 to 11 of ARSIWA.)
/E (B. Attribution 45. Thailand affirms that attribution of cyber activities to a State must be consistent with the established principles of international law. A cyber operation is attributable to a State if it is carried out by its organs, or by persons or groups acting on its instructions, or under its direction or control, among other forms of attribution, in accordance with Articles 4 to 11 of ARSIWA.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
