/E (51. Thailand emphasizes that countermeasures should only be adopted as a measure of last resort, after efforts to resolve the dispute peacefully have been exhausted. Thailand encourages States to prioritize dialogue, transparency, mutual assistance, and confidence-building measures to address incidents in cyberspace, and to work through regional and international frameworks to prevent escalation and maintain international peace and security.)
