/T (52. Thailand reaffirms that, in accordance with Article 2\(3\) and Chapter VI of the Charter of the United Nations, States must settle their international disputes through peaceful means in a manner that does not endanger international peace, security, or justice.)
/E (52. Thailand reaffirms that, in accordance with Article 2\(3\) and Chapter VI of the Charter of the United Nations, States must settle their international disputes through peaceful means in a manner that does not endanger international peace, security, or justice.)
