/S /H2
/T (53. Thailand emphasizes that a wide range of peaceful means is available to States, including negotiation, inquiry, mediation, conciliation, arbitration, judicial settlement, and recourse to regional agencies or arrangements. Thailand encourages States to prioritize dialogue, cooperation to prevent escalation and to address incidents in cyberspace in a peaceful, transparent, and constructive manner.)
